\title{SigfoxTagPrep: Download, Process, and Analyse Sigfox Wildlife Tracking Data}
\description{
Tools for working with ICARUS/Sigfox wildlife tracking tags (TinyFox, NanoFox, uWasp). Provides functions to download raw transmission data from the MPIAB Sigfox database or Movebank, convert it to move2 objects, compute movement metrics (speed, distance, bearing, displacement, VeDBA), add environmental covariates from ERA5 rasters, detect tag fall-off events, and identify continuous nocturnal flight bouts.
